{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1290484-rolling-with-rote-with-9-again","id":1290484,"title":"Rolling with Rote with 9-Again","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-21T12:24:27-08:00","id":1290484,"title":"Rolling with Rote with 9-Again","content":"Can you do both of these things at the same time? Can I make a Rote roll, rerolling all failed dice, while also rolling 9's again... and would it then also do 9's again with the failed dice from the rote?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23776-raktus","name":"Raktus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T13:09:00-08:00","id":1290505,"title":"","content":"Let's say you have a dice pool of 6d 9A Rote<br /> <br /> You roll 2, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10<br /> * 3 successes<br /> * 3 fails to Rote reroll<br /> * 2 again rolls (9&amp;10)<br /> <br /> Rote reroll is 3, 8, 9<br /> * 2 successes<br /> * 1 again reroll<br /> <br /> You have 3d again for rerolls<br /> * 2 from the original and 1 from the Rote. <br /> * Roll s 4, 5, 8 (1 success)<br /> <br /> Total of 6 successes on 6 dice! Rotes are powerful. <br /> <br /> The 9 and 10 agains would happen after the Rote because the Rote is rerolling failed rolls and none of the 9/10 again would be failed rolls. <br /> <br /> I recommend having extra sets of different colored dice to keep the rotes and agains straight. <br /> <br /> Best regards","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T13:54:07-08:00","id":1290524,"title":"","content":"The much simpler method is just rerolling all failed dice first and then rerolling any X Again dice. No need for different coloured dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}